# 연례 데이터 갱신 때 version·date-released 를 함께 갱신한다 (docs/operations.md §2.5).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  이 소프트웨어·데이터셋을 인용할 때는 아래 정보를 쓰고, 원자료(교육부·한국교육개발원
  「교육기본통계」)도 함께 밝혀 주세요.
type: software
title: 'K-MOSAIC: Korea Multicultural Student Data Explorer'
abstract: >-
  An interactive explorer of multicultural-student statistics for Korea's 17
  provinces. The numerator comes from the e-Nara index (F008403), the
  denominator from KOSIS education statistics (elementary, middle, high and
  miscellaneous schools), and every share is computed and validated before a
  snapshot is committed.
authors:
  - family-names: Lim
    given-names: Taehyeong
version: 0.2.0
date-released: '2026-10-04'
license: MIT
url: 'https://taehyeonglim.github.io/k-mosaic/'
repository-code: 'https://github.com/taehyeonglim/k-mosaic'
keywords:
  - multicultural students
  - education statistics
  - Korea
  - open data
  - data visualization
references:
  - type: data
    title: 교육기본통계 (Statistical Yearbook of Education)
    authors:
      - name: 교육부 (Ministry of Education)
      - name: 한국교육개발원 (Korean Educational Development Institute)
    url: 'https://www.index.go.kr/unify/idx-info.do?idxCd=F0084'
